<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal cereal output to rise this year.</title>
<headline>Portugal cereal output to rise this year.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's cereal production will be higher in 1996 than last year but below the average over the last five years, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said in its July outlook.</p>
<p>INE provided the following figures in tonnes for cereals:</p>
<p>			 1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Oats	     63,000		  58,000</p>
<p>    Barley	   58,000		  53,000</p>
<p>    Rye		44,000		  36,000</p>
<p>    Wheat	   414,000		 360,000</p>
<p>Note - 1996 figures are provisional.</p>
<p>----Lisbon Editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
